<Base title="CV | zodiak">
  <div lang="en">
    <h1>Mateo Aja Moral</h1>
    <p class="muted">SRE / Performance Engineer</p>
    <p class="muted">Cantabria, Spain</p>
    <p class="noprint">
      <a href="mailto:mateoaja11@gmail.com">mateoaja11@gmail.com</a>
      <span class="muted"> | </span>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/mateo-aja-moral">LinkedIn</a>
      <span class="muted"> | </span>
      <a href="https://github.com/ZodiakDrinker">GitHub</a>
      <span class="muted"> | </span>
      <a href="/cv.pdf">Download PDF</a>
    </p>

    <p>
      Engineer experienced with Docker, Kubernetes, Jenkins and Terraform, with a passion for
      optimizing deployment processes and ensuring reliable, scalable systems. Motivated, quick
      learner, and eager to grow into a Cloud/DevOps leadership role.
    </p>

    <h2>Work Experience</h2>
    <div class="job">
